  dialogue:
    character: {fileID: 584213497, guid: 5d7a500b15e65d3499df83ac5f56ef87, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: 2069893085192945066, guid: 18b983b6af9e3e840bf005f9f12452ae, type: 3}
    name: Rommel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - He is not one to use his tongue for conversation. One would understand him
      by the look in his eyes. Well, that is my personal experience.
    - 'He almost never speaks his thoughts in full. These days, however, I admit
      that it has been getting more and more difficult to talk to him.

'
