      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'I am not anticipating a fight. I want to show them the truth. I want
        to show Rommel the real future he is building. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "How can we call that \u201Cuniting Giyala\u201D when they are not even
        empowered to their own capabilities? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: How can Giyala be saved with the weapons of our own oppressors?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
